%% Interrupt and resume sequence
sequenceDiagram
  participant O as Orchestrator
  participant CP as CheckpointStore
  participant H as Human
  participant A as ApprovalService
  O->>CP: checkpoint before gate
  O->>O: interrupt
  O->>H: awaiting approval
  H->>A: approve or revise
  A->>O: Approval record
  O->>CP: restore
  O->>O: resume graph
  O->>CP: checkpoint after resume
